# devtodev | Product Analytics Platform

Collect data from all sources, make data insightful, and grow your products.

## Product Analytics Features

- [Analyze user journeys in detail](https://www.devtodev.com/product/analyze-user-journeys-in-detail): This feature allows users to track and analyze the paths taken by users within the product, providing insights into user behavior and engagement.
  
- [Experiment to grow your product](https://www.devtodev.com/product/experiment-to-grow-your-product): Users can conduct experiments to test different features or changes, helping to identify what drives user engagement and product growth.

- [Predict future metrics](https://www.devtodev.com/product/predict-future-results): This functionality enables users to forecast key performance indicators based on historical data, aiding in strategic planning and decision-making.

- [Monitor product performance](https://www.devtodev.com/product/monitor-your-performance): Users can keep track of various performance metrics to ensure the product is functioning optimally and meeting user needs.

- [Get insights from all sources](https://www.devtodev.com/product/get-insights-from-all-sources): This feature aggregates data from multiple sources, providing a comprehensive view of user interactions and product performance.

- [Dive deeper into data](https://www.devtodev.com/product/dive-deeper-into-data): Users can explore detailed analytics to uncover trends and patterns that may not be immediately visible.

- [Solve in-game problems](https://www.devtodev.com/product/solve-in-game-problems): This tool assists game developers in identifying and resolving issues within their games, enhancing user experience.

